{"text": "It was very dark, and the wind howled horribly around Dorothy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But after the first few whirls, the house rocked gently, like a babys cradle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Toto did not like it, and he ran about the room, barking loudly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Once he fell through the open trap door, and Dorothy thought she had lost him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon, however, she saw one of his ears sticking up through the hole. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The strong pressure of the air was holding him up, so he could not fall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She crept to the hole, caught Toto by the ear, and dragged him into the room again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then she closed the trap door so that no more accidents could happen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hour after hour passed, and slowly Dorothy got over her fright, though she felt quite lonely. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She stopped worrying and decided to wait calmly and see what the future would bring. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last she crawled over the swaying floor to her little bed, and Toto, who followed her, lay down beside her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In spite of the wailing wind, Dorothy soon closed her eyes and fell fast asleep.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", " ", "h", "o", "w", "l", "e", "d", " ", "h", "o", "r", "r", "i", "b", "l", "y", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "D", "o", "r", "o", "t", "h", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "r", "s", "t", " ", "f", "e", "w", " ", "w", "h", "i", "r", "l", "s", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", " ", "r", "o", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "g", "e", "n", "t", "l", "y", ",", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", "